<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 17.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 17.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for March 17 on Friday. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		    17.03.97     14.03.97</p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.3740	 6.4112</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3447	 2.3618</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.5526	 4.5830</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.2317	 3.2727</p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5170	 0.5240</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.7855	 0.7915</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2931	 0.2952</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.8711	 6.8805</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.7009	 0.7021</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.2950	 1.3005</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
